* @title Gimpel basic string functions
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapters 3.1, 3.4, 3.5, 3.7, 3.11, and 3.15; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* A1B2C3
* MSSSS
* BLNOOS
* 3
* BB
* DEABC
* MISP
* <<<
-INCLUDE "BLEND.INC"
-INCLUDE "DIFF.INC"
-INCLUDE "ORDER.INC"
-INCLUDE "COUNT.INC"
-INCLUDE "REPL.INC"
-INCLUDE "ROTATER.INC"
-INCLUDE "SKIM.INC"
	OUTPUT = BLEND('ABC','123')
	OUTPUT = DIFF('MISSISSIPPI','IP')
	OUTPUT = ORDER('SNOBOL')
	OUTPUT = COUNT('BANANANA','ANA')
	OUTPUT = REPL('AAAA','AA','B')
	OUTPUT = ROTATER('ABCDE',2)
	OUTPUT = SKIM('MISSISSIPPI')
END
